  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_5747.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(12 fotos) Aquest dimecres han comen&ccedil;at a Suera els tres dies seguits de vaques i bous dins de les festes d&#39;agost, ja que dissabte es dedica exclussivament als actes d&#39;esgl&egrave;sia.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/CanyaRockSuera.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 676px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les exhibicions taurines tindran un par&egrave;ntesi la nit d&#39;aquest dijous amb el festival Canya Rock, a l&#39;explanada de la Font Seca.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5728.jpg\" alt=\"img_5728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5729.jpg\" alt=\"img_5729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5734.jpg\" alt=\"img_5734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5738.jpg\" alt=\"img_5738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5743.jpg\" alt=\"img_5743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5744.jpg\" alt=\"img_5744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5745.jpg\" alt=\"img_5745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boudimecressueraagost15/img_5747.jpg\" alt=\"img_5747\" style=\"max